# Safe Refactoring

Preserve existing functionality.

Do NOT:
- change database schema
- change API contracts
- change authentication
- remove features
- change business logic
- break existing tests

Only improve:
- structure
- readability
- duplication
- maintainability
- performance where safe

When refactoring, also follow `.cursor/skills/code-simplification/SKILL.md`.
